blesFeature.types.ts#L64)\n\nA map of optional external atoms, one per `TableState` slice. Consumers can\nprovide their own writable atom for any state slice to take over ownership\nof that slice.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ExternalAtoms\ntitle: ExternalAtoms\n---\n\n# Type Alias: ExternalAtoms\\<TFeatures\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExternalAtoms<TFeatures> = Partial<{ [K in keyof TableState<TFeatures>]: Atom<TableState<TFeatures>[K]> }>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [core/table/coreTablesFeature.types.ts:64](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/core/table/coreTablesFeature.types.ts#L64)\n\nA map of optional external atoms, one per `TableState` slice. Consumers can\nprovide their own writable atom for any state slice to take over ownership\nof that slice.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n"}
